WEBVTT

00:00:00.468 --> 00:00:01.166
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.095 --> 00:00:06.533
<v><b>F:</b></v> I can’t afford a new car, it’s going to have to be second-hand.

00:00:08.534 --> 00:00:09.288
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:10.113 --> 00:00:14.452
<v><b>F:</b></v> Despite being nearly 93, my mum is incredibly youthful.

00:00:16.563 --> 00:00:17.373
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:18.179 --> 00:00:22.788
<v><b>M:</b></v> I’ve never heard a singing voice like Sally’s – she has a totally original talent.

00:00:25.019 --> 00:00:25.781
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:26.622 --> 00:00:31.383
<v><b>M:</b></v> During the Second World War, thrifty shoppers could make a little money go a long way.

00:00:33.276 --> 00:00:34.071
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:40.552
<v><b>F:</b></v> I wouldn’t get that dress - it looks really cheap, as if it would fall apart after one wash.

00:00:42.639 --> 00:00:43.556
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:48.354
<v><b>M:</b></v> I know he’s probably trying to be nice, but I find him a bit smarmy.

00:00:50.322 --> 00:00:51.174
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:00:52.031 --> 00:00:55.559
<v><b>F:</b></v> I’m making a determined effort to give up eating chocolate.

00:00:57.409 --> 00:00:58.134
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

00:00:58.998 --> 00:01:03.635
<v><b>M:</b></v> They launched an aggressive advertising campaign intended to annihilate the competition.